# Send only the inputs needed by Dockerfile, not the private working tree.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!man_spider/
!man_spider/**

# Exclusions still apply inside the admitted runtime package.
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.manspider
**/.manspider-container-home
**/logs
**/loot
**/benchmark-artifacts
**/benchmark-corpus
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/stand.txt
**/*.ccache
**/*.keytab
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*.sqlite.*
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/*.sqlite3.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.review
**/*.review-*
**/*.review.*
**/*.log
**/*.smb-metrics.json
**/*.unclassified-files.jsonl
